# Lotuslight Dancers' "black" is a color word of its text (CR 612.1, 612.2): with the enters trigger on the stack Bot1 changes it with Sleight of Mind to
# "red", so the trigger searches for a red card, a green card and a blue card. Lightning Bolt (red) can be found and Dark Ritual (black) no longer
# can; Bot1 takes the Bolt, Giant Growth and Ancestral Recall. Everything happens on Bot1's second turn, when the draw has given the sixth mana.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Lotuslight Dancers
Sleight of Mind
Island
Dark Ritual
Giant Growth
Ancestral Recall
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lotuslight Dancers.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sleight of Mind.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Lotuslight Dancers)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Colors(Black)
Bot1.Colors(Red)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Search(Dark Ritual)
Bot1.Search(Lightning Bolt; Giant Growth; Ancestral Recall)
? Bot1.Graveyard.Lightning Bolt.Colors.Count = 1
? Bot1.Graveyard.Giant Growth.Colors.Count = 1
? Bot1.Graveyard.Ancestral Recall.Colors.Count = 1
? Bot1.Graveyard.Dark Ritual = (absent)

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard.Lightning Bolt.Colors.Count = 1
Bot1.Graveyard.Dark Ritual = (absent)
